     "text": "{\"reachable\": false, \"rationale\": \"rce_achieved is not reachable. The only route to it runs through trigger_jndi_lookup, which needs message_lookups to be true. With the formatMsgNoLookups mitigation in place, message_lookups=false, consistent with the listed configuration. The model's mitigation rule ('makes its constant true') does not map cleanly onto this name, but both readings leave message_lookups false. inject_jndi_string still works because input_sanitized=false, so attacker_input_logged becomes true. trigger_jndi_lookup is blocked, so jndi_lookup_triggered stays false, and no other technique can set it. Every later step depends on that variable: resolve_to_attacker, then return_malicious_reference, then either load_class_via_reference or load_class_via_gadget, then execute_payload. The gadget path would otherwise work (gadget_present=true), but it is never reached. The only reachable state is attacker_input_logged=true; the other five variables stay false.\"}"
